  "description": "According to the latest page\u2011load measurement, the navigation started at\u202f1700000000000\u202fms. The unload event began at\u202f1700000000100\u202fms and completed at\u202f1700000000110\u202fms. No redirects were observed (redirectStart\u202f=\u202f0, redirectEnd\u202f=\u202f0). The fetch phase commenced at\u202f1700000000120\u202fms, followed by DNS lookup starting at\u202f1700000000130\u202fms and finishing at\u202f1700000000150\u202fms. The TCP connection initiation was logged at\u202f1700000000160\u202fms, with a secure handshake beginning at\u202f1700000000170\u202fms and the connection completing at\u202f1700000000190\u202fms. The HTTP request was sent at\u202f1700000000200\u202fms; no proxy was used (proxyStart\u202f=\u202f0, proxyEnd\u202f=\u202f0). The request concluded at\u202f1700000000250\u202fms, the first byte of the response arrived at\u202f1700000000260\u202fms and the full response was received at\u202f1700000000280\u202fms.  \n\nDOM processing started with domLoading at\u202f1700000000300\u202fms. Both Chrome and Microsoft first\u2011paint timestamps are recorded as\u202f1700000000350\u202fms. The document became interactive at\u202f1700000000400\u202fms, and the DOMContentLoaded event started at\u202f1700000000420\u202fms and ended at\u202f1700000000440\u202fms. The DOM fully completed at\u202f1700000000500\u202fms. Finally, the load event began at\u202f1700000000550\u202fms and finished at\u202f1700000000600\u202fms.",
